{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01E6YmDzfXySjNeLR3YBKoVS","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t//! Translation of `picoquic/newreno.c` — standalone New Reno congestion control.\n2\t//!\n3\t//! The embedded New Reno simulator ([`NewRenoSimState`], [`NewRenoAlgState`])\n4\t//! lives in [`crate::cc_common`] because several other congestion-control\n5\t//! algorithms share it.  This module provides the per-path algorithm state\n6\t//! used when New Reno runs as the primary (non-embedded) controller.\n7\t\n8\tuse crate::cc_common::{MinMaxRtt, NewRenoSimState};\n9\t\n10\t/// Per-path state for the standalone New Reno algorithm.\n11\t/// C: `picoquic_newreno_state_t` (picoquic/newreno.c:177-180).\n12\t#[derive(Default)]\n13\tpub struct NewrenoState {\n14\t    pub nrss: NewRenoSimState,\n15\t    pub rtt_filter: MinMaxRtt,\n16\t}\n17\t\n18\timpl NewrenoState {\n19\t    /// Observe the current algorithm phase and slow-start threshold.\n20\t    ///\n21\t    /// Returns `(cc_state, cc_param)` where `cc_state` is the numeric\n22\t    /// discriminant of [`crate::cc_common::NewRenoAlgState`] (`SlowStart = 0`,\n23\t    /// `CongestionAvoidance = 1`) and `cc_param` is `ssthresh` (reported as\n24\t    /// `0` when `ssthresh == u64::MAX`, meaning the threshold has not yet\n25\t    /// been set).\n26\t    ///\n27\t    /// C: `picoquic_newreno_observe` (picoquic/newreno.c:309-314).\n28\t    pub fn observe(&self) -> (u64, u64) {\n29\t        let cc_state = self.nrss.alg_state as u64;\n30\t        let cc_param = if self.nrss.ssthresh == u64::MAX {\n31\t            0\n32\t        } else {\n33\t            self.nrss.ssthresh\n34\t        };\n35\t        (cc_state, cc_param)\n36\t    }\n37\t}\n38\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f89f9153-c014-4310-b972-78fe66d716ab","uuid":"52242d6e-b2ce-4373-b736-bea217ea6826","timestamp":"2026-05-07T14:12:37.959Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/richbarn/Projects/picoquic/rs/fq/src/newreno.rs","content":"//! Translation of `picoquic/newreno.c` — standalone New Reno congestion control.\n//!\n//! The embedded New Reno simulator ([`NewRenoSimState`], [`NewRenoAlgState`])\n//! lives in [`crate::cc_common`] because several other congestion-control\n//! algorithms share it.  This module provides the per-path algorithm state\n//! used when New Reno runs as the primary (non-embedded) controller.\n\nuse crate::cc_common::{MinMaxRtt, NewRenoSimState};\n\n/// Per-path state for the standalone New Reno algorithm.\n/// C: `picoquic_newreno_state_t` (picoquic/newreno.c:177-180).\n#[derive(Default)]\npub struct NewrenoState {\n    pub nrss: NewRenoSimState,\n    pub rtt_filter: MinMaxRtt,\n}\n\nimpl NewrenoState {\n    /// Observe the current algorithm phase and slow-start threshold.\n    ///\n    /// Returns `(cc_state, cc_param)` where `cc_state` is the numeric\n    /// discriminant of [`crate::cc_common::NewRenoAlgState`] (`SlowStart = 0`,\n    /// `CongestionAvoidance = 1`) and `cc_param` is `ssthresh` (reported as\n    /// `0` when `ssthresh == u64::MAX`, meaning the threshold has not yet\n    /// been set).\n    ///\n    /// C: `picoquic_newreno_observe` (picoquic/newreno.c:309-314).\n    pub fn observe(&self) -> (u64, u64) {\n        let cc_state = self.nrss.alg_state as u64;\n        let cc_param = if self.nrss.ssthresh == u64::MAX {\n            0\n        } else {\n            self.nrss.ssthresh\n        };\n        (cc_state, cc_param)\n    }\n}\n","numLines":38,"startLine":1,"totalLines":38}}}
