th full C body translations; added MINRTT_MARGIN to imports -- cargo fmt && cargo test --no-run && cargo clippy --tests --all-features -- -D warnings (all clean)\n# [2026-05-07] Phase 4B missing batch (5 items: BBRInitRoundCounting, BBROnInit, BBRSetBdpSeed, BBRSetCwnd, BBRSetPacingRate): added impl Default for BbrState (equivalent to C memset); added helpers update_max_inflight + bound_cwnd_for_probe_rtt; all 5 functions implemented in bbr.rs with full C body translation -- cargo fmt && cargo test --no-run && cargo clippy --tests --all-features -- -D warnings (all clean)\n# [2026-05-07] Phase 4B missing batch (5 items: ech_get_retry_config, get_default_callback_context, get_rtt, registered_token_create, add_proposed_alpn): items 1-3 were already implemented — stale body-line numbers in the map caused false-positive \"incomplete\" flags; fixed by scripts/fix_phase4b_map_entries.py; items 4-5 had no Rust counterpart — added RegisteredToken::splay_node (C: registered_token_create, architectural equivalent of intrusive node extractor) in internal.rs and Connection::add_proposed_alpn (C: add_proposed_alpn, pushes ALPN string to alpn_proposals Vec bounded by ALPN_NUMBER_MAX) in tls_api.rs; added alpn_proposals: Vec<String> field to Connection struct -- cargo fmt && cargo test --no-run && cargo clippy --tests --all-features -- -D warnings (all clean)\n# [2026-05-07] Phase 4B missing impl batch: parse_hexa_digit + string_create + set_abs_delay in utils.rs; adapt_lower_bounds_from_congestion + adapt_upper_bounds + helpers (advance_max_bw_filter, probe_inflight_hi_upward, start_round, start_probe_bw_down, handle_inflight_too_high, check_inflight_too_high, pick_probe_wait, pick_probe_wait_early, bbr_random, random_int_between) in bbr.rs -- cargo fmt && cargo test --no-run && cargo clippy --tests --all-features -- -D warnings (all clean)\n# [2026-05-07] Phase 4B missing batch (5 items: open_network_wake_up, packet_loop_set_fds, spinbit_basic_incoming, spinbit_basic_outgoing, s